// Aster's kick (M5 C8): a front kick out of the punch, the right knee drawn up, the foot driven out at the
// chest on a skip forward, and set back down into her guard. Hit on ticks 10 to 13, as `hero.moves.ron`
// frames it; back in her guard by tick 36.
//
// Turns are degrees in the model's rest space, about each bone's own joint, X then Y then Z. She faces +Z,
// with her left arm along +X at rest. Ticks are 60 a second. `root` is where the move has carried her,
// `hips` moves the hips from rest. Both hands are fists throughout.
(
    type: "sapphire::pipeline::KeyPoseClip",
    version: 1,
    data: (
        ticks: 36,
        keys: [
            // Her guard, as the punch starts from.
